      "This leads to common symptoms such as:",
      "\u2022 Repeated sneezing.\n\u2022 An itchy nose.\n\u2022 A watery or runny nose.\n\u2022 Nasal congestion.\n\u2022 Itchy, red, or watery eyes.\n\u2022 Throat irritation caused by mucus drainage.",
