      'Sudden, severe pelvic pain, fainting, or severe pain with possible pregnancy requires urgent medical attention.',
      'Treatment depends on the underlying cause and may include pain relief, hormonal medication, lifestyle measures, or specialist treatment.',
      'You do not have to tolerate disabling period pain. Early diagnosis can help improve quality of life and reduce delays in treatment.'
